    "pdpPlainTextPreview": "Represents one of the key sovereign issues of the twenty‑first century for collectors building a narrative of her reign in coinage\nWE ARE STRENGTHENING ACCOUNT SECURITY AND PROTECTING YOUR ACCESS WITH 2 STEP VERIFICATION. FIND OUT MORE Home Sovereign All Sovereign Coins 2022 Elizabeth II Platinum Jubilee Gold Proof Sovereign Share via Gold Proof 2022 Elizabeth II Platinum Jubilee Gold Proof Sovereign Price: £1,080.00 EMAIL ME WHEN IN STOCK Email Me When In Stock PRODUCT CODE: HIS22PJPS Struck in 2022 in 22 carat gold to an exceptional proof standard, marking the Platinum Jubilee year of Queen Elizabeth II Celebrates an unprecedented seventy-year reign, the first Platinum Jubilee of a British monarch Obverse bears Jody Clark’s fifth definitive coinage portrait of Queen Elizabeth II, introduced in 2015 and used throughout her later reign Special one-year-only reverse replaces St George and the dragon with a royal design for the Platinum Jubilee Proof finish combines deeply mirrored fields with frosted reliefs, enhancing every element of the jubilee artwork Produced to the classic modern sovereign specifications for weight, diameter and alloy, continuing a tradition dating back to 1817 Represents one of the key sovereign issues of the twenty‑first century for collectors building a narrative of her reign in coinage Gold Proof Read the full description YOU MIGHT ALSO BE INTERESTED IN ADD TO BASKET Britannia 2026 1oz Silver Bullion Coin £62.52 In Stock ADD TO BASKET Britannia 2022 1 oz Silver Bullion Coin £61.32 In Stock ADD TO BASKET Level 5 Genius Medal £9.95 In Stock ADD TO BASKET Britannia 2026 1oz Gold Bullion Coin £3,487.00 In Stock ADD TO BASKET 100th Anniversary of the Birth of Queen Elizabeth II 2026 UK £5 Brilliant Uncirculated Coin £17.50 In Stock ADD TO BASKET Britannia 2026 1oz Silver Bullion Twenty-Five Coin Tube £1,483.00 In Stock ADD TO BASKET Level 4 Mastermind Medal £9.95 In Stock ADD TO BASKET Britannia 1g Gold Bullion Minted Bar £140.78 In Stock ADD TO BASKET Level 3 Decoder Medal £9.95 In Stock ADD TO BASKET Level 2 Explorer Medal and Collector Folder £9.95 In Stock The 2022 Elizabeth II Platinum Jubilee Gold Proof Sovereign is a landmark issue that honours an unprecedented seventy years of service by Britain’s longest‑reigning monarch. Struck in 22 carat gold to the finest proof standard, the coin unites exceptional craftsmanship with a historic royal milestone, offering a distinguished tribute from one of the most important years in modern numismatics. The obverse features Jody Clark’s definitive fifth portrait of Her Late Majesty Queen Elizabeth II, capturing the dignity and continuity of a reign that began in 1952 and reached its Platinum Jubilee in 2022. For this special year, the sovereign departs from the traditional St George and the dragon and instead carries a bespoke royal reverse design, created specifically to celebrate the Platinum Jubilee. This commemorative reverse incorporates refined heraldic and royal motifs that pay homage to the Queen’s long service, while still preserving the classical elegance and balance that have defined the sovereign for more than two centuries. Struck to proof quality, every detail of the design is brought sharply into focus, with frosted reliefs standing out against mirror‑polished fields to dramatic effect. As one of the final special‑reverse sovereigns issued during Queen Elizabeth II’s lifetime, the 2022 Platinum Jubilee Gold Proof Sovereign holds particular significance for collectors of both royal and sovereign series coinage. Struck to the traditional specifications of the modern sovereign, it represents a moment when national celebration, royal history and the timeless artistry of the sovereign all come together in a single, beautifully finished coin. SPECIFICATION Specification Value Denomination Sovereign Alloy 22 Carat Gold Weight 7.98 g Diameter 22.05mm Reverse Designer Timothy Noad Specification Value Obverse Designer Jody Clark Quality Proof Year 2022 Pur"
